        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate Cupid is an isometric, rogue-like, action-adventure, shooter game. You play as Cupid, an angel sent by God to heal sad corporate workers by shooting them with his Love Arrows. Infuse each floor with Cupid’s love and aim for the top to face the big, bad, CEO of the company. Defeat him and free the suffering souls once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You defend yourself with the use of Love Arrows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Love Arrows will have different effects. Power-ups will be balanced with effects like Increased Charge Time in order to keep the game challenging. You will shoot Love Arrows at the enemies in order to heal their Souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy encounters will become more challenging through increase in enemy HP, Def, ATK, or Quantity. You will be able to receive additional rewards based on the time completion time of each level.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate Cupid is an isometric, rogue-like, action-adventure, shooter game. You play as Cupid, an angel sent by God to heal sad corporate workers by shooting them with his Love Arrows. Infuse each floor with Cupid’s love and aim for the top to face the big, bad, CEO of the company. Defeat him and free the suffering souls once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You defend yourself with the use of Love Arrows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Love Arrows will have different effects. Power-ups will be balanced with effects like Increased Charge Time in order to keep the game challenging. You will shoot Love Arrows at the enemies in order to heal their Souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy encounters will become more challenging through increase in enemy HP, Def, ATK, or Quantity. You will be able to receive additional rewards based on the time completion time of each level.</p>",
        "short_description": "Corporate Cupid is an isometric, rogue-like, action-adventure, shooter game. Infuse each floor with Cupid’s love and aim for the top to face the big, bad, CEO of the company. Defeat him and free the suffering souls once and for all.",
